  <content>
  <section><para>Solve each equation mentally. Then, enter your answer to check it.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><title>Warm Up Activity</title><exercise data-content-id="859dc981-9328-4243-9d12-9fe5fdf40386"><problem><para>
      <para>\(40-8=40+n\)</para>
      <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
    </para></problem><solution><para>-8</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is \(– 8\).</para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
